# Measurement-rig raw captures (rig/README.md; decisions/0011): every `init`
# event carries an absolute home path, so these never get committed. Kept
# OUTSIDE the managed block below on purpose — that block is rewritten
# wholesale by ./setup.sh, and an entry placed inside it would be silently
# dropped the next time anyone reruns the script.
/rig/runs/

